Section 0: Initial Setup
Section 0.1: Downloading the Program
Download this folder

Section 0.2: Downloading the Program Requirements
In Finder (File Explorer on Windows), right click on the unzipped Trajectory Generators folder
To right click on Mac, click using 2 fingers
In the menu that opens, click on New Terminal at Folder
A terminal window should open up. Wait to see “Trajectory Generators %” before proceeding to next step

Type in “pip install -r requirements.txt” and press Enter. Everything should be ready to go! Proceed to Section 1 to open the program

Section 1.1: Opening the Program

In Finder (File Explorer on Windows), right click on the unzipped Trajectory Generators folder
In the menu that opens, click on New Terminal at Folder
A terminal window should open. Wait to see “Trajectory Generators %” before proceeding to Step 4
Type in “python launcher.py” and press Enter (Return on Windows)

Click on Randomized Trajectory Generator to open the 
This is the main point where you will encounter errors
After a few seconds, the program should open and you should see this window.

